5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need a sustainable system for the year. Let's look into the actual time and costs involved before deciding.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. A logically fair distribution requires data on who is actually using the space and how much effort is required.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want it to be clean every time! It's like a mystery game where I never know if the kitchen is scary or not!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely if we could all feel at peace. I wonder if we can clarify the costs of our supplies too.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us seek a path that preserves our friendship. Harmony is far more valuable than a spotless floor.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, that's why we need to define what ""done"" means. @Shizue, checking the receipts for supplies is a good start.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely. If we don't quantify the labor and the usage, we are merely guessing at fairness.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, defining ""done"" sounds like a puzzle! I want to know why it changes so much!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, Minako. I just want to make sure no one is feeling burdened by the costs in secret.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,A shared understanding is the seed of peace. Let us look at the patterns of our lives together.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I'll focus on the time commitment. We should also consider if an outside firm is a viable alternative to save our time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A professional firm might be efficient, though perhaps an expensive luxury. I'm more interested in the internal usage patterns.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I want to see the calendar! Maybe there's a secret pattern to the mess!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think looking at the management office rates and the supply receipts would be very helpful for us.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the history of this house and how we communicate. The heart of the home is in its records.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let's finalize our choices then. I'll check the timing and the firm's terms.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the kitchen usage and the house chat records to see where the labor actually sits.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm going for the calendar and the ""what counts as done"" list! I'll solve the mystery!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the bathroom spray receipts and the management office rate sheet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will examine the notes from previous tenants and the grout from July. Let us learn from those who came before.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
