33,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The actual time is higher than I expected. A full pass takes over an hour and a half. It's a significant burden.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Interestingly, the usage is heavily skewed. A few of us are doing the bulk of the cooking, yet the cleaning is split equally.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found it! The ""done"" list is a mess! Everyone has a different idea of what clean is! No wonder it's a surprise every day!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I noticed we are buying the same supplies multiple times. Also, the costs are quite irregular and not clearly shared.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants warned us that rigid divisions can lead to silence between friends. We must be careful not to build walls.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if usage is skewed, we could adjust the rotation. But the time cost remains high regardless of who does it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Exactly. It is logically inconsistent to expect someone who barely enters the kitchen to spend the same time cleaning it as a frequent user.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if we just rotate, the ""done"" problem stays! One day it's super clean, then the next day it's... yuck! We need a rule!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I worry that if we just rotate, the person buying the sponges will still be the one who happens to be at the store.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Rules are useful, but when they become weapons, they destroy the spirit. Let us find a way to support each other.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"An outside firm would remove the labor, but the terms say we still have to tidy up first. It doesn't remove all the work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we hire a firm, the cost is shared, but the usage imbalance remains. However, it would eliminate the ""standard of clean"" disputes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,A professional cleaner would be like a magic spell! Everything would be the same every time! I love that idea!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we go with a firm, we must be very clear about the monthly billing so no one is left out of pocket.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"I noticed the bathroom grout returns to filth quickly. No matter who cleans, the house itself fights us. We must be kind to ourselves.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"We have three paths: a usage-based rotation, a strict standard-based rotation, or a professional firm. We must weigh time against money.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A usage-based system is the most fair, but a professional firm is the most rational way to avoid interpersonal conflict.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I don't want a rotation if it means the kitchen is grim again! I vote for the magic professional cleaners!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I prefer a system where the costs are transparent. A professional firm with a fixed monthly bill would be very clear.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I fear that a rotation based on usage will lead to resentment and counting. Let us choose the path that keeps us talking.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
