60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option B is the most efficient. It removes the bulk of the hours from our schedule, which is my primary concern.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"While Option A is traditional, Option B is the only one that solves the ""standard of clean"" issue and the usage imbalance simultaneously.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Option B! Option B! I want the professional magic! No more guessing if the bathroom is a monster today!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Option B. A professional invoice is much easier to split fairly than keeping track of who bought the bleach.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"I have seen many friendships wither over a dirty dish. If we can afford it, let us pay for the peace of mind.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"The only downside to B is the cost, but the time we regain is worth more than the money spent.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logically, the cost is a flat tax on our peace. It is a far more stable investment than the emotional labor of a rota.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, you're using big words, but I think we all mean the same thing! Let's just get the pros!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"As long as we have a clear way to pay the bill every month, I am very happy with this choice.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"When we remove the source of friction, we leave room for kindness. I support the professional service.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,I'm confident in this. It's the only way to ensure the time burden is actually removed rather than just shifted.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. It is the most rational solution to a multi-variable problem of time, usage, and quality.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,Yay! No more scary kitchens! I'm so excited to see it always look the same!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It will be a relief for everyone. We can spend our time enjoying each other's company instead of arguing over sponges.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. Let us treat this as an investment in our shared happiness. A home is a sanctuary, not a battlefield.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,It seems we are in total agreement. Let's move to the vote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I see no logical reason to deviate. The consensus is clear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready! Let's do it!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am happy we could all agree so gently.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,May this decision bring us closer together. I am ready to vote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
